# The handoff's logo sources are 3MB each — traced outlines, not real vector.
# They stay on disk so scripts/build-assets.mjs can regenerate the WebP logos,
# but they are not worth 6MB in every clone. The generated src/assets/*.webp
# ARE committed, so the site builds without them.
